stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft: inspection created
  Draft --> InProgress: checklist started
  InProgress --> Draft: save draft
  InProgress --> Submitted: submit with signature
  Submitted --> NeedsReview: suspicious signals found
  Submitted --> Approved: manager confirms
  NeedsReview --> Approved: validated manually
  NeedsReview --> Rejected: invalid report
  Approved --> IssueCreated: fail items detected
  IssueCreated --> RepairInProgress: repair assigned
  RepairInProgress --> RepairDone: work completed
  RepairDone --> Closed: verification done
  Rejected --> [*]
  Closed --> [*]
